WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.371
This is RED EYE:

00:00:01.371 --> 00:00:03.667
a free caption and video editor that

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:05.390
runs right in your browser.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.085
It now looks like a pro editor,

00:00:08.085 --> 00:00:09.140
with four pages:

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.130
Edit, Subtitle,

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:11.317
Audio and Deliver.

00:00:11.317 --> 00:00:12.505
Let's make a reel,

00:00:12.505 --> 00:00:13.560
start to finish.

00:00:14.009 --> 00:00:15.026
Open the editor.

00:00:15.026 --> 00:00:17.187
The Project Manager shows all your

00:00:17.187 --> 00:00:18.140
saved projects.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.174
Press Shift 1, or click the Home

00:00:20.174 --> 00:00:22.399
button, to come back here any time.

00:00:22.852 --> 00:00:24.193
Click New Project,

00:00:24.193 --> 00:00:26.131
and pick the Reels preset:

00:00:26.131 --> 00:00:28.962
1080 by 1920, at 30 frames per second.

00:00:29.414 --> 00:00:30.404
Give it a name,

00:00:30.404 --> 00:00:31.526
and click Create.

00:00:31.526 --> 00:00:34.034
Your project saves itself as you work.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.129
This is the Edit page.

00:00:43.129 --> 00:00:44.249
In the Media Pool,

00:00:44.249 --> 00:00:46.490
click Import, and choose your clips.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.889
Click a clip to see it in the Source

00:00:48.889 --> 00:00:50.406
viewer. The Timeline viewer,

00:00:50.406 --> 00:00:52.030
on the right, plays your edit.

00:00:52.479 --> 00:00:54.901
Your clips sit on the timeline:

00:00:54.901 --> 00:00:56.854
video on V1, sound on A1,

00:00:56.854 --> 00:00:59.510
and captions on their own subtitle

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:00.369
track, ST1.

00:01:00.823 --> 00:01:03.327
Select a clip, and the Inspector shows

00:01:03.327 --> 00:01:04.579
its settings: zoom,

00:01:04.579 --> 00:01:05.567
position, crop,

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:06.753
opacity and speed.

00:01:07.204 --> 00:01:08.555
Press B for the Blade,

00:01:08.555 --> 00:01:10.213
and click a clip to cut it.

00:01:10.213 --> 00:01:12.178
Press A to go back to Selection.

00:01:12.178 --> 00:01:14.204
Control B splits at the playhead.

00:01:14.655 --> 00:01:17.536
Press I and O to mark an In and an

00:01:17.536 --> 00:01:19.230
Out. Made a mistake?

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:20.925
Control Z undoes it.

00:01:21.376 --> 00:01:23.131
Now open the Subtitle page,

00:01:23.131 --> 00:01:24.691
and click Auto subtitle.

00:01:24.691 --> 00:01:26.511
The AI writes your captions,

00:01:26.511 --> 00:01:27.876
right on your device.

00:01:28.371 --> 00:01:30.658
Every line is timed to the speech.

00:01:30.658 --> 00:01:32.811
Click any line to edit the text.

00:01:33.262 --> 00:01:35.199
Then pick a style and a font.

00:01:35.199 --> 00:01:37.202
The preview updates instantly.

00:01:43.814 --> 00:01:45.658
Made a typo? Run Spell check.

00:01:45.658 --> 00:01:47.820
It finds mistakes and suggests the

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:48.074
fix.

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:49.965
Or use the voice box.

00:01:49.965 --> 00:01:51.747
Tap the mic, say the word,

00:01:51.747 --> 00:01:53.187
and RED EYE types it,

00:01:53.187 --> 00:01:55.655
with other spellings to choose from.

00:01:58.887 --> 00:02:00.014
On the Audio page,

00:02:00.014 --> 00:02:02.081
Clean up voice removes background

00:02:02.081 --> 00:02:03.521
noise from your speech.

00:02:03.521 --> 00:02:04.711
Pick Light, Medium,

00:02:04.711 --> 00:02:05.337
or Strong.

00:02:05.789 --> 00:02:08.020
Open the Mixer to see your track

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:10.461
levels, so voice and music sit just

00:02:10.461 --> 00:02:10.879
right.

00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:12.306
When you're done,

00:02:12.306 --> 00:02:13.626
go to the Deliver page,

00:02:13.626 --> 00:02:15.691
and pick the Instagram Reels preset.

00:02:16.142 --> 00:02:18.297
Set an In and an Out to render just

00:02:18.297 --> 00:02:19.652
part of your timeline,

00:02:19.652 --> 00:02:21.315
or leave it clear to render

00:02:21.315 --> 00:02:21.992
everything.

00:02:22.443 --> 00:02:24.118
Click Add to Render Queue,

00:02:24.118 --> 00:02:25.149
then Render All.

00:02:25.149 --> 00:02:27.533
Your MP4 is saved when it's finished.

00:02:30.516 --> 00:02:32.929
RED EYE also comes as an app for Mac,

00:02:32.929 --> 00:02:34.690
Windows, Linux and Android.

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:36.973
Get it from the Download section of

00:02:36.973 --> 00:02:37.756
the website.

00:02:38.209 --> 00:02:39.359
And in Settings,

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:42.019
Make fully offline downloads every AI

00:02:42.019 --> 00:02:43.959
model, about 1.6 gigabytes,

00:02:43.959 --> 00:02:46.044
so captions, voice typing and

00:02:46.044 --> 00:02:48.272
background removal work with no

00:02:48.272 --> 00:02:48.919
internet.

00:02:50.523 --> 00:02:51.981
That's RED EYE.

00:02:51.981 --> 00:02:55.383
Try it free at redeye-cq1.pages.dev
